    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39216" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prōvīsor</span></b> ,
		ōris, m.
		provideo. * <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A foreseer</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ingruentium dominationum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. A.
					12, 4</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A provider</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">utilium tardus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor. A.
					P. 164</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">PROVISORI. EIVSDEM. PROVINCIAE,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Inscr. Orell. 105</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ORDINIS (decurionum),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">ib. 3766</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">civitatis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg. 2
					Macc. 4, 2</span></i>
			.</div>
